# Changie unreleased fragments live here (one YAML file per change).
#
# Create one with `changie new` (interactive) or hand-write a file following
# `.changes/samples/`. At release time `changie batch <version> --project <p>`
# folds every fragment for a project into its Keep-a-Changelog file and (without
# --keep) clears this directory. This .gitkeep keeps the directory tracked when
# it is otherwise empty.
